```

### Proposed Enhancement

Add substep tracking:

```ts
interface PlanProgress {
  currentStep: number;
  status: "in_progress" | "completed";
  note?: string;
  substeps?: Array<{
    // granular progress within a step
    label: string;
    status: "pending" | "running" | "completed" | "failed";
  }>;
