## Decision Schema (Already Exists)

The LLM emits decisions to control runtime:

```ts
interface Decision {
  action: "complete" | "sleep" | "notify" | "stop" | "wait";
  reason?: string;
  statePatch?: Record<string, unknown>;
  sleepUntil?: Date;
  waitFor?: { description: string; expiresInSeconds?: number };
  observation?: { type: string; content: Record<string, unknown> };
  notification?: {
    type: string;
    channel: "in-app" | "webhook";
    subject?: string;
    body?: Record<string, unknown>;
  };
  planProgress?: PlanProgress;
}
```

### Proposed Enhancement

Add `question` action for LLM to ask the user:

```ts
interface Decision {
  action: "complete" | "sleep" | "notify" | "stop" | "wait" | "question";
  // ... existing fields
  question?: {
    text: string; // the question
    options?: string[]; // optional multiple choice
    allowCustomAnswer: boolean;
    context?: string; // why this question matters
  };
}
```

